BT 1 0 0 1 0 40.4 Tm /F1 9.2 Tf 12.4 TL (A bounded priority queue drops expired work and, when full, sheds the least urgent queued request. A separate) Tj T* (degradation policy selects the richest path whose estimated latency fits the remaining deadline: full, lite, extractive, then) Tj T* (optionally wait; work is dropped when the deadline is gone or no allowed path fits. The configured queue capacity,) Tj T* (concurrency ceiling, patience, and latency estimates are policy hypotheses, not provider measurements.) Tj T* ET
