q
.090196 .141176 .227451 rg
BT 1 0 0 1 0 52.8 Tm /F1 9.2 Tf 12.4 TL (The load generator samples popular questions with Zipf-like skew, so duplicates can arrive concurrently. AnswerCache) Tj T* (combines TTL entries with single-flight tasks. The canonical hash key includes question, provider, model map, retrieval) Tj T* (setting, semantic/rerank flags, and degradation level. Only successful, answerable, gate-accepted results are cached.) Tj T* (This avoids replaying rejected drafts or reusing a result across a different model or retrieval configuration. TTL and) Tj T* (capacity defaults remain unverified workload settings.) Tj T* ET
Q
Q
