q
.090196 .141176 .227451 rg
BT 1 0 0 1 0 52.8 Tm /F1 9.2 Tf 12.4 TL (Retries are permitted only for timeout, rate-limit, and server-error classes. The policy honors Retry-After when present;) Tj T* (otherwise it uses full-jitter exponential backoff. It refuses a retry after the per-request attempt cap, expired deadline, or) Tj T* (exhausted process-wide retry budget. These defaults are labeled unverified. The answer-quality experiment disabled) Tj T* (retries so a rate limit was recorded instead of replaying a request. A separate seeded stand-in test returned a persistent) Tj T* (503: retrying added 351.2 ms and still failed, while the no-retry case ended in 2.203 ms.) Tj T* ET
