.090196 .141176 .227451 rg
BT 1 0 0 1 0 40.4 Tm /F1 9.2 Tf 12.4 TL (A FastAPI server implements an OpenAI-compatible streaming endpoint, Groq-shaped rate-limit headers, rolling) Tj T* (request/token windows, configurable seeded slow successes, 5xxs, hangs, SSE chunking, and load-dependent delay.) Tj T* (Admin endpoints allow limit changes during a run. The load generator is open-loop and includes steady, burst,) Tj T* (sustained overload, halved per-minute limit, exhausted daily budget, and retry-worse comparisons.) Tj T* ET
